    "anchor": "changes-to-the-end-of-campaign-phase",
    "summary": "These Dominatus deck steps move from the end of each campaign phase to the next campaign phase’s first battle, during its Determine Mission step:\n\n- the Acquire Relics and Discard steps\n- the Test of Mettle and Fresh Supplies location bonuses\n\nAuspicious Augury is resolved as the deck says, ideally with someone from a different Alliance watching.",
